Multiple key=value pairs apply in one call, each landing in the resulting frontmatter.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
status: draft
title: Probe plan
sp: 0
---

Body paragraph one.

Second paragraph.
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md status=ready sp=13
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 ---
-status: draft
+status: ready
 title: Probe plan
-sp: 0
+sp: 13
 ---
 
 Body paragraph one.
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: status=ready, sp=13
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
status: ready
title: Probe plan
sp: 13
---

Body paragraph one.

Second paragraph.
-- exit --
0
